id=WaterFilterStrawB42
name=[B42] Water Filter Straw
description=This mod introduces the water filter straw, a game-changing tool that allows players to drink from contaminated water sources. With this lightweight and portable device, survival becomes easier in the post-apocalyptic world. Purify tainted water instantly and stay hydrated. <BR>

description=You can drink from contaminated sources directly, such as puddles, rivers, lakes, and shorelines. Contaminated containers such as water bottles, canteens, and pots may also be drank if they are in your inventory and you also have a water filter straw.  <BR>

description=Each straw has 30 uses before it is depleted and you will have to find another. You may right click the straw to pull up a menu of contaminated drinking sources in your inventory that you are eligible to drink from.  <BR>
 
description=They can be found on zombies,camping stores, fishing stores, safehouses, and other survival based locations.  <BR>

description=You can also craft one with  <BR>
